415
00:34:51,901 --> 00:34:58,900
In the past it was with water mills driven, later on it was driven with steam engine.

416
00:34:58,901 --> 00:35:07,680
Today we have machines with the capacity from 13,000 pounds and with a huge powerful motor

417
00:35:07,681 --> 00:35:14,580
that can create up to 1800 RPMs and everything is computer controlled.

418
00:35:14,581 --> 00:35:19,760
The temperatures are controlled, the speed is controlled, you can run clockwise, you

419
00:35:19,761 --> 00:35:23,520
You can run anti-clockwise, you're adding cocoa butter in,

420
00:35:23,521 --> 00:35:26,320
you have about 20 to 30 different steps

421
00:35:26,321 --> 00:35:28,480
in the inside of the conch.

422
00:35:30,460 --> 00:35:34,280
After conching, the chocolate is molded into hollow orbs.

423
00:35:34,281 --> 00:35:38,120
We're filling one half of the mold set with chocolate.

424
00:35:38,121 --> 00:35:40,560
We're putting on the top half of the mold set,

425
00:35:40,561 --> 00:35:43,480
and then we're going through a series of three rotations,

426
00:35:43,481 --> 00:35:45,260
gently swirling the chocolate

427
00:35:45,261 --> 00:35:47,660
around the inside of the mold cavity.

428
00:35:47,661 --> 00:35:51,720
And by doing so, we're creating a hollow sphere.

429
00:35:51,721 --> 00:35:53,760
Once the shells have cooled and hardened,

430
00:35:53,761 --> 00:35:58,780
in goes the filling, topped off with a dab of chocolate

431
00:35:58,781 --> 00:36:00,320
to make sure nothing leaks out.

432
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:08,720
What makes the secret chocolate filling recipe unique

433
00:36:08,721 --> 00:36:12,980
is that lint has found a way to lower its melting point,

434
00:36:12,981 --> 00:36:15,060
creating a cooling sensation in your mouth.

435
00:36:17,660 --> 00:36:19,960
Lindor truffles may taste expensive,

436
00:36:19,961 --> 00:36:22,340
but Lindt's ability to mass produce them

437
00:36:22,341 --> 00:36:24,440
ensures that premium chocolate won't send you

438
00:36:24,441 --> 00:36:25,260
to the poorhouse.

439
00:36:29,240 --> 00:36:32,600
Good thing, too, because there's about to be a mad rush

440
00:36:32,601 --> 00:36:34,580
